{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Patchset 2 (Gerrit change 2359) — module-size gate remediation.\n\nCI run 33225269535 on patchset 1 failed ONLY at the module-size gate: src/rebar/_store/gitutil.py reached 833 LOC (cap 800; it was 788 pre-change with no headroom, and the ~45-line run_auto_maintenance addition overflowed it). No test/logic failure.\n\nFix (behaviour-preserving relocation along an existing call-graph seam):\n- Moved run_auto_maintenance() from gitutil.py into src/rebar/_store/event_commit_git.py (its natural home — the bounded git-verb module every lock-held commit already uses; event_commit_git imports only from gitutil, so no import cycle). gitutil.py now 798 LOC; event_commit_git.py 238 LOC.\n- _AUTOMAINT_OFF config tuple stays in gitutil.py (shared).\n- Updated importers event_append.py and txn.py to import run_auto_maintenance from event_commit_git.\n- Fixed 2 argv-shape test breakages in tests/interfaces/store/test_review_regressions.py: the fake commit-failure interceptors matched the commit via args[:1] == (\"commit\",), but _AUTOMAINT_OFF now prepends -c gc.auto=0 -c maintenance.auto=false; switched both to membership (\"commit\" in args). Swept the whole tests/ tree for other positional commit-argv heuristics — all others already use robust \"commit\" in cmd membership.\n\nValidation (worktree venv): make lint clean; make typecheck clean (683 files); module-size contract + c2ba parity + all git-fake surfaces (delete/batch/index/import/event_append_index_lock/review_regressions) + txn/compact/fsck + the bd66 RED->GREEN regression all GREEN. gitutil.py 798<=800, event_commit_git.py 238<=800.\n\nCommit amended (Change-Id I661dac4a preserved), re-pushed as patchset 2. plan-review PASS certificate unchanged (this remediation is a source-relocation + test-only fix; ticket description/file_impact untouched to preserve currency). Awaiting fresh Verified (CI) and LLM-Review votes; will not close until Verified +1 AND merged."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787968033310322001,"uuid":"09365915-396d-4723-be73-faab3e3fff57"}